This license covers all material authored in this repository, including root
files, .github/, configuration, scripts/, rule sources, and the first-party
packs under packs/ (clssck-core, clssck-development, and sanofi).
Exceptions:
- packs/clssck-core/skills/cli-creator/ remains under Apache-2.0; see
  licenses/clssck-core/cli-creator/LICENSE.txt.
- The `Command Scope` section of packs/sanofi/skills/dbt/SKILL.md and reference
  files in packs/sanofi/skills/dbt/ adapted from dbt-labs/dbt-agent-skills
  remain under Apache-2.0; see licenses/sanofi/dbt/.

License texts, attributions, and provenance notes for third-party material
adapted in the packs written here live in licenses/, never inside those skill
directories; vendored packs and upstream/ copies keep the license files their
upstreams ship.

Everything else is a vendored copy of third-party work and remains under its
own terms. The five coco-* packs under packs/ are copies of Snowflake Cortex
Code bundled plugins; each carries its own LICENSE and ATTRIBUTION file. The
directories under upstream/ are copies of the repositories listed in
sources.json at their pinned commits; each carries the license files shipped by
its repository, including any per-skill LICENSE files inside skills/. See the
files inside each pack directory for the terms that apply to it.
